    disclaimerTitle: 'Отказ от ответственности',
    acceptTermsLabel:
      'Я прочитал(а) и принимаю Условия использования, Политику конфиденциальности и Правовую информацию. Понимаю, что Swaply — только платформа посредничества между пользователями и не участвует в продажах.',
    mustAcceptTerms:
      'Для регистрации необходимо принять Условия и Политику конфиденциальности.',
    legalFooterNote:
      'Сделки совершаются исключительно между пользователями. Swaply не является стороной договора и не гарантирует транзакции.',
    publishLegalNote:
      'Публикуя объявление, вы подтверждаете законное владение, достоверность информации и то, что сделка заключается только между вами и покупателем.',
    marketplaceDisclaimer:
      'Swaply помогает коллекционерам связаться. Мы не обрабатываем платежи, не храним товары и не разрешаем споры. Каждый пользователь действует на свой риск.',
    termsContent:
      "TERMS OF USE — SWAPLY\n\n1. Nature of the service\nSwaply is a digital platform that allows adult users to post and browse collectible listings (TCG cards and related items). Swaply is NOT a seller, buyer, payment intermediary, or custodian of goods.\n\n2. Relationship between users\nAny sale, trade or agreement is concluded SOLELY between the seller and the buyer. Swaply is not a party to that contract and assumes no obligations arising from it.\n\n3. Limitation of liability\nTo the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Swaply and its operators shall not be liable for: (a) accuracy of listings; (b) quality, authenticity or legality of items; (c) payment, shipping or delivery; (d) disputes, fraud, breaches or damages between users; (e) economic or data loss.\n\n4. User obligations\nYou warrant that you have legal capacity; information you post is truthful; you have the right to sell listed items; you will not post illegal, misleading or infringing content; and you comply with your country's laws (consumer, tax, shipping, intellectual property).\n\n5. Content and moderation\nWe may remove listings, suspend accounts or restrict access where there are indications of fraud, abuse, unlawful content or breach of these terms, without obligation to compensate.\n\n6. Accounts and security\nYou are responsible for keeping your credentials confidential and for activity under your account.\n\n7. Mandatory law\nNothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot be limited by law (e.g. willful misconduct or gross negligence, depending on jurisdiction).\n\n8. Severability\nIf any clause is invalid, the remainder stays in force.\n\n9. Acceptance\nBy registering or using Swaply you accept these Terms, the Privacy Policy and the Legal Notice.",
    privacyContent:
      'PRIVACY POLICY — SWAPLY\n\n1. Controller\nData is processed to operate the Swaply platform (account, listings, basic messaging and security).\n\n2. Data we process\nRegistration data (email, username), profile data, listing content, messages between users, technical connection data (IP, device, approximate location) and language/currency preferences.\n\n3. Purposes\nCreate and manage your account; display listings and enable user contact; security, fraud prevention and moderation; comply with legal obligations when required.\n\n4. Legal bases\nPerformance of the service relationship, legitimate interest in platform security and, where applicable, consent (e.g. browser geolocation).\n\n5. Retention\nWhile the account is active and for additional time needed for security, disputes or legal duties.\n\n6. Recipients\nWe do not sell your data. Essential technical providers (hosting, authentication) may process data under security measures. Authorities when required by law.\n\n7. International transfers\nCloud services may process data in other countries with appropriate safeguards where required.\n\n8. Rights\nDepending on your jurisdiction you may request access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection or portability. Use in-app support. You may also delete your account from your profile.\n\n9. Minors\nThe service is intended for users with legal capacity. It is not directed at children without parental consent where required by law.\n\n10. Location\nLocation shown to other users is approximate (privacy radius), not exact.\n\n11. Changes\nWe may update this policy. Continued use after material changes means you are aware of the new version.',
    legalNoticeContent:
      "LEGAL NOTICE AND DISCLAIMER — SWAPLY\n\n1. Technical intermediation platform\nSwaply provides a technology space for users to publish listings and communicate. We do not operate a store of third-party listed products.\n\n2. No participation in sales\nWe do not take part in negotiation, payment, shipping or delivery. We do not charge a commission on user-to-user sales (unless expressly stated and accepted in the future).\n\n3. No warranties on products or users\nWe do not guarantee authenticity, condition, lawful origin, or the conduct of buyers or sellers. Use caution, verify identity reasonably and choose secure payment methods yourself.\n\n4. User regulatory compliance\nEach user is responsible for complying with their country's laws: taxes, customs, intellectual property, consumer protection and rules on restricted goods.\n\n5. Limitation of damages\nTo the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect damages, lost profits, data loss or claims between users.\n\n6. Contact\nFor legal or privacy queries, use the in-app support channel.\n\n7. Important\nThis text is a practical baseline and does NOT replace advice from a lawyer in your jurisdiction. Have a professional adapt these texts before a formal commercial launch.",
    locationAutoRegisterHint:
      '📍 Местоположение определяется автоматически при создании аккаунта (ок. 10 км, никогда точно).',
